<title>UK: LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</title>
<headline>LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Reuter - Following are the buying and selling rates for leading world currencies and gold against the dollar on the London foreign exchange and bullion markets today.</p>
<p>US$1.00 COSTS    1.3872/77 Canadian Dollars</p>
<p>		     1.7220/30 German Marks</p>
<p>		     1.9370/80 Dutch Guilders</p>
<p>		     1.4700/10 Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     35.56/57  Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     5.8074/97   French Francs</p>
<p>		     1704.0/5.0  Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     126.53/63   Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     7.8010/60   Swedish Crowns</p>
<p>		     7.0784/04   Norwegian Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.5571/91   Danish Crowns</p>
<p>One Sterling     US$1.6222/32</p>
<p>Gold (ounce)     US$340.20/70</p>
